Package: bayesvis
Type: Package
Title: Extended Bayesian Visualization Diagnostics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Utkarsh", "Pawade",
           email = "utkarshpawade2@gmail.com",
           )
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Description: An extension prototype for the 'bayesplot' package providing
    advanced Bayesian visualization capabilities. Implements prior-to-posterior
    shrinkage diagnostics ('mcmc_shrinkage()'), LOO probability integral
    transform plots ('ppc_pit_hist()', 'ppc_pit_qq()'), rank-based ECDF
    diagnostics ('mcmc_rank_ecdf()'), and posterior predictive coverage plots
    ('ppc_coverage()'). All plots return 'ggplot2' objects and integrate with
    'bayesplot' themes and color schemes, making 'bayesvis' a natural companion
    to the 'bayesplot' workflow.
